    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is David. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352724266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to make a return.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93979,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352728866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Certainly, I can assist with that. To get started, what specifically is the issue with the item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352730666666
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a jersey. It's the wrong size.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93979,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352737266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. And is it a technical fault with the item, or more of a preference issue? For example, is the cut not what you expected, or is it just too tight?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352739799999
    },
    {
      "text": "It's too tight. I guess your sizing is different. I'd like to do an exchange or just get a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93979,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352750133332
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. I just need to pull up your order to check the return eligibility. Do you have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352756866665
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. It's VF88602.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93979,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352764866665
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment... Okay, I see the order. It looks like you purchased the Pro-Vent jersey, and it was delivered 66 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352766333331
    },
    {
      "text": "And?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93979,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352775199997
    },
    {
      "text": "And you are well within our 90-day return window for standard items. So, yes, we can absolutely process that for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352775899997
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. Must be my lucky day.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93979,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352783899997
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just initiated the return in our system. I'm sending a pre-paid shipping label to the email address on file right now. You can use that to send the jersey back for a full refund. Did you still want to set up an exchange for a larger size, or just process the return for now?",
