      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352785966663
    },
    {
      "text": "Just the return. Whatever.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93979,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766352804766663
    },
    {
      "text": "Not a problem at all. The label is on its way. Once our warehouse receives the item, your refund will be issued back to your original payment method. Is there anything else I can help you with today?",
